### Constraint tests — preparatory & incompatible
### Run with server up: `node index.js`
### Use REST Client; requests share session cookies in this file.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001

### 0) Login as bob (simple part-time plan in seed)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sessions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "bob",
  "password": "password"
}

### 1) Reset bob to a small working plan (24 CFU — valid for part-time save)
# Expected: 200, plan with 4 courses
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/study-plan
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "courses": ["01OTWOV", "01SQLOV", "01UDFOV", "01OUZPD"]
}

### --- PREPARATORY (05BIDOV requires 02GOLOV) ---

### 2) Add 05BIDOV without 02GOLOV in plan
# Expected: 400 { "error": "PREPARATORY", "message": "...02GOLOV..." }
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/study-plan/courses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "courseCode": "05BIDOV"
}

### 3) Add preparatory 02GOLOV first
# Expected: 200, plan includes 02GOLOV
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/study-plan/courses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "courseCode": "02GOLOV"
}

### 4) Add 02LSEOV while only 02GOLOV is extra (incompatible pair)
# Expected: 400 { "error": "INCOMPATIBLE", "message": "...02LSEOV...02GOLOV..." }
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/study-plan/courses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "courseCode": "02LSEOV"
}

### 5) Add 05BIDOV now (02GOLOV is preparatory)
# Expected: 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/study-plan/courses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "courseCode": "05BIDOV"
}

### 6) Try to remove 02GOLOV while 05BIDOV still in plan
# Expected: 400 { "error": "PREPARATORY", "message": "...05BIDOV depends..." }
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/study-plan/courses/02GOLOV

### 7) Remove 05BIDOV first, then 02GOLOV is allowed
# Expected: 200, 200
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/study-plan/courses/05BIDOV

DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/study-plan/courses/02GOLOV

### --- INCOMPATIBLE on bob's existing courses (01UDFOV vs 01TXYOV) ---

### 8) Add 01TXYOV — bob still has 01UDFOV from step 1
# Expected: 400 { "error": "INCOMPATIBLE" }
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/study-plan/courses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "courseCode": "01TXYOV"
}

### 9) Inspect catalog: preparatory & incompatible on courses list
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/courses

### 10) Restore bob seed plan (optional)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/study-plan
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "courses": ["01OTWOV", "01SQLOV", "01UDFOV", "01OUZPD"]
}
